00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:20.530
<i>On top of sound</i>

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:23.310
<i>Crossing, sounding, singing</i>

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:26.070
<i>Where the sound of the sand ends up</i>

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:29.700
<i>Around and around, revolving, 
you spin your tale</i>

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:31.940
<i>Toward a crucible of sound</i>

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:34.740
<i>This is a song to reach you</i>

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:36.700
<i>Hey, listen</i>

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:40.770
<i>I've missed you all this time</i>

00:01:40.770 --> 00:01:43.220
