00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:21.450
<i>I can keep going</i>

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:25.060
<i>Around and around, 
tumbling as we dance and spin</i>

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:27.020
<i>On top of sound</i>

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:29.830
<i>Crossing, sounding, singing</i>

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:32.530
<i>Where the sound of the sand ends up</i>

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:36.280
<i>Around and around revolving, never ending</i>

00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:38.510
<i>Toward a crucible of sound</i>

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:41.470
<i>If I resound what's in my heart</i>

00:02:40.210 --> 00:02:41.120
<i>Momo.</i>

