00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:03.410
<i>Whether I'm awake or asleep, I sing</i>

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:05.300
<i>I'm nothing more than a canary</i>

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:10.480
<i>Drowning in sweet, glistening lies</i>

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:12.920
<i>Damn it! We're being dragged in.</i>

00:04:11.410 --> 00:04:13.770
<i>Whether I'm awake or asleep, I peck</i>

