00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:32.250
<i>No... This is even crazier.</i>

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:37.040
<i>When I shout, that alone makes me invincible</i>

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:34.460
<i>How far will you take this?</i>

00:04:37.350 --> 00:04:39.040
<i>Right now, it's as if you're...</i>

