00:05:16.320 --> 00:05:20.320
I don't know how to put it. 
It's like he's full of emotion.

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:25.510
<i>As I'm carried away by the flow, I awaken</i>

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:27.620
