Ever since then, I've always...

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:06.200
always, always...

00:14:06.890 --> 00:14:10.200
been overflowing with songs 
that I wanted you to sing.

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:12.430
I'll write for tomorrow.

00:14:13.050 --> 00:14:14.950
I'll write my own sound.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:17.270
I won't stop.

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:18.460
What are you going to do?

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:24.930
I don't know.

00:14:25.330 --> 00:14:26.770
What should I do?

00:14:27.520 --> 00:14:30.910
I see. You're the same 
stupid mask girl as always.

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:33.220
Do you really think that was your limit?

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:34.220
That was it?

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:36.570
What do you mean, "that was it"?!

00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:38.070
I was singing with all I had!

00:14:38.070 --> 00:14:39.420
I was desperate!

00:14:41.220 --> 00:14:45.150
I put so much into it, I felt like it'd 
be okay if I could never sing again.

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:46.330
Are you going to give up?

00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:52.240
Can you really give up?

00:15:12.810 --> 00:15:15.470
You always come out of the blue, Nino-chan.

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:17.650
Why are you here today?

00:15:17.650 --> 00:15:19.510
Sorry to bother you during work.

00:15:19.910 --> 00:15:20.930
Kuze-san, well—

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:22.970
If you're looking for Momo, 
I still haven't found him.

00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:24.950
I see...

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:29.990
This is Rock Horizon, isn't it?

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:30.730
Yeah.

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:32.610
Huh?

00:15:32.920 --> 00:15:37.960
For a second there, didn't it look like 
Momo stopped to look into the distance?

00:15:38.430 --> 00:15:40.250
Oh, that part?

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:42.080
After the concert, he told me

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:45.590
that he heard your voice for a second.

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:49.640
He heard my voice?

00:15:50.160 --> 00:15:51.130
Yes.

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:54.860
<i>So it reached him?</i>

00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:02.100
Alice, let's crush this.

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:07.110
<i>He's right. Let's sound out 
with all of our sound.</i>

00:16:07.740 --> 00:16:08.790
Isn't this...

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:11.110
I'm getting excited.

00:16:13.710 --> 00:16:15.430
<i>The sounds I couldn't hear before...</i>

00:16:15.930 --> 00:16:17.700
<i>The cheers I couldn't hear...</i>

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:20.080
<i>I can hear them all now.</i>

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:21.580
<i>Here it comes.</i>

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:23.080
<i>Here it comes.</i>

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:24.580
<i>Here it comes.</i>

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:25.830
<i>Here it comes.</i>

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:29.130
<i>Now, it's time for our last song!</i>

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:30.730
<i>I won't let you leave.</i>

00:16:33.190 --> 00:16:34.130
<i>Momo...</i>

00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:36.170
<i>I'll reach you!</i>

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:40.050
<i>Empty words</i>

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:42.230
<i>And conversations full of lies</i>

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:45.480
<i>And scratches left on the desk</i>

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:53.200
<i>Worn-out smiles, in the prison prepared 
by adults under the dark sky</i>

00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:55.700
<i>When I stretch out my hand</i>

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:57.700
<i>You slip and fall</i>

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:01.140
<i>You wrench open your falling eyelids</i>

00:16:58.640 --> 00:17:02.460
<i>Alice, I've kept on writing because 
I wanted you to sing my songs.</i>

00:17:02.460 --> 00:17:06.630
<i>But I thought that wish would never come true, 
so I'd decided this song would be my last.</i>

00:17:03.340 --> 00:17:06.630
<i>When I say, "Look at me"</i>

00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:10.800
<i>But this is the song that let us meet again.</i>

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:10.800
<i>These unrequited feelings will never change</i>

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:13.580
<i>The path we took can never be changed</i>

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:12.910
<i>Finally...</i>

00:17:13.980 --> 00:17:16.230
<i>Just let everything go</i>

00:17:14.370 --> 00:17:15.970
<i>Finally, your voice</i>

00:17:16.230 --> 00:17:18.280
<i>Far out into the sky</i>

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:18.280
<i>has come close enough that I can reach it!</i>

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:22.770
<i>Shout out! This song is the melody inside you</i>

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:28.150
<i>Overflowing with all your 
love, wishes, and lies</i>

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:27.020
<i>My voice, and everyone's sound,</i>

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:28.150
<i>right now,</i>

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:30.650
<i>Shout out!</i>

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:30.650
<i>have perfectly combined into one!</i>

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:33.590
<i>I'm hiding my heart by singing</i>

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:32.450
<i>Reach him.</i>

00:17:33.590 --> 00:17:35.150
<i>Come to me</i>

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:35.150
<i>Reach him.</i>

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:36.160
<i>My voice!</i>

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:37.740
<i>Hear the sound of my heart</i>

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:38.950
<i>Sound out!</i>

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:40.410
<i>The words stuck in my throat and my eyes</i>

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:40.410
<i>Our sound!</i>

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:42.750
<i>The girl who's forever swimming</i>

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:42.750
<i>Reach him! Reach him!</i>

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:44.670
<i>A lie that only I know</i>

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:44.240
<i>Momo!</i>

00:17:56.950 --> 00:18:00.140
Apparently, the black cats' show
ended earlier than expected.

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:02.820
Get going, Alice.

00:18:11.180 --> 00:18:13.440
Damn it. How stupid am I?

00:18:17.140 --> 00:18:19.320
Nino? What are you doing?

00:18:20.270 --> 00:18:21.320
Come here.

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:23.870
Have some self-awareness. You're a performer.

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:28.300
Did Momo go to see you before 
the concert, by any chance?

00:18:28.300 --> 00:18:29.050
Yes.

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:32.960
He's disappeared.

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:38.630
<i>So, Rock Horizon is happening right now,</i>

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:41.080
<i>and we're bringing you a live feed!</i>

00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:46.110
<i>Take a listen to In NO hurry 
to Shout's "High School."</i>

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:48.880
<i>Empty words</i>

00:18:49.320 --> 00:18:51.370
<i>And conversations full of lies</i>

00:18:51.970 --> 00:18:54.190
<i>And scratches left on the desk</i>

00:18:55.680 --> 00:18:56.240
<i>Momo.</i>

00:18:57.010 --> 00:18:57.740
<i>Momo.</i>

00:18:58.400 --> 00:18:59.490
<i>Momo!</i>

00:19:04.130 --> 00:19:05.220
<i>I put everything...</i>

00:19:05.550 --> 00:19:08.790
<i>I put everything into my 
song just now, and yet...</i>

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:10.370
<i>I couldn't stop you again.</i>

00:19:11.110 --> 00:19:12.540
<i>Now I can never see you again!</i>

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:19.260
Momo...

00:19:29.450 --> 00:19:36.020
<i>Twinkle, twinkle, little star</i>

00:19:34.630 --> 00:19:35.590
<i>Momo,</i>

00:19:36.370 --> 00:19:38.360
<i>I wish I could have at least</i>

00:19:37.600 --> 00:19:44.310
<i>How I wonder what you are</i>

00:19:39.300 --> 00:19:40.930
<i>told you I like you.</i>

00:19:45.610 --> 00:19:53.090
<i>Up above the world so high</i>

00:20:04.130 --> 00:20:08.770
You never change. You still sleep 
with your arms up like that.

00:20:19.340 --> 00:20:20.710
What are you doing?

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:23.220
Relax.

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:24.950
The contest is off.

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:26.520
I'm going to disappear.

00:20:27.210 --> 00:20:28.460
Disappear?

00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:31.220
You're gonna pull the same 
thing as six years ago?

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:33.870
Leaving again without saying you like her?

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:36.250
Screw you.

00:20:36.810 --> 00:20:38.080
Screw you!

00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:41.520
I'm going to take Alice for sure this time.

00:20:58.130 --> 00:20:59.120
Momo,

00:21:00.010 --> 00:21:01.530
I like you.

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:17.290
Seriously, screw him.

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:18.940
That clueless punner.

00:21:23.500 --> 00:21:24.660
<i>I reached him.</i>

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:26.680
Goodbye.

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:30.430
<i>I couldn't stop him.</i>

00:21:30.850 --> 00:21:32.680
<i>But, for just a moment,</i>

00:21:33.110 --> 00:21:34.180
<i>just a moment,</i>

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:35.820
<i>just a moment,</i>

00:21:36.610 --> 00:21:37.980
<i>I reached him.</i>

00:21:38.320 --> 00:21:39.950
I'll ask you again.

00:21:39.950 --> 00:21:41.110
Why are you here today?

00:21:42.060 --> 00:21:45.360
I came to get a running start.

00:21:56.210 --> 00:21:57.080
Yuzu.

00:21:57.970 --> 00:21:58.980
Alice?

00:21:58.980 --> 00:22:01.710
Why are your bangs all crooked?

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:03.710
They got in the way when 
I was running, so I cut them.

00:22:03.710 --> 00:22:05.400
That's way too avant-garde!

00:22:05.400 --> 00:22:06.340
Thank you.

00:22:07.300 --> 00:22:08.990
Thank you, Yuzu.

00:22:09.540 --> 00:22:12.320
I can't give up on Momo.

00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:15.630
So I won't run away anymore.

00:22:16.700 --> 00:22:19.280
<i>That's how she always, always is.</i>

00:22:19.840 --> 00:22:20.730
Me, too.

00:22:21.300 --> 00:22:22.110
I won't run away.

00:22:22.680 --> 00:22:26.610
<i>No matter how shaken you get, you always 
run with all your might in the end.</i>

00:22:27.510 --> 00:22:30.120
<i>And you always end up 
standing in front of this ocean.</i>

00:22:31.100 --> 00:22:33.050
<i>We're hiding how we truly feel.</i>

00:22:33.480 --> 00:22:35.870
<i>Our one and only wish.</i>

00:22:37.010 --> 00:22:37.850
<i>Please...</i>

00:22:38.370 --> 00:22:39.630
<i>I pray it reaches you.</i>

00:22:40.480 --> 00:22:42.130
<i>I pray it reaches you.</i>

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:45.740
<i>I pray it reaches you.</i>
